        {"node_id": "skp-desires-087", "label": "Anchoring AI accountability in human decisions and material power relations rather than system mental states", "priority": 4, "why": "normative commitment — responsibility must track developer and deployer knowledge, recklessness, and negligence, which immunity severs"},
