        {"node_id": "skp-beliefs-212", "label": "Legal and Regulatory Gaps in AI Governance", "confidence": 0.90, "why": "primary anchor — the gap is in remedy architecture, and a table-based no-fault system does not close it for non-enumerable harms"},
