        {"node_id": "skp-intentions-095", "label": "Apply Causal Modeling to Ensure AI Decisions Are Independent of Protected Characteristics", "operationality": 3, "why": "strategy — counterfactual fairness gives a concrete alternative test to variance reduction"}
