      "angle": "Everything valuable in this proposal is severable from the immunity. Keep the excise tax, the hardware-level telemetry, the cryptographically verifiable audit trails, and the subpoena-armed board; delete the shield; and add parent-company joint liability with compulsory insurance and sectoral runtime observability. This is the stronger hybrid — ex ante standards plus intact ex post liability, as in aviation, pharmaceuticals, and nuclear power.",
